[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9721.59, "timestamp": "02:42:01", "text": "有意思，因为他叫你巴汉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9725.71, "timestamp": "02:42:05", "text": "Kaland，这意味着你的禁令已生效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9727.95, "timestamp": "02:42:07", "text": "迪克。就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9730.63, "timestamp": "02:42:10", "text": "不尊重人。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9739.349, "timestamp": "02:42:19", "text": "对了，乔，我想问你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9742.389, "timestamp": "02:42:22", "text": "你的印地语水平如何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9744.87, "timestamp": "02:42:24", "text": "好的。我还没听你讲过印地语呢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9746.79, "timestamp": "02:42:26", "text": "很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9750.55, "timestamp": "02:42:30", "text": "没错。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9753.75, "timestamp": "02:42:33", "text": "把它想象成 10 个标准 10 个标准"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9756.389, "timestamp": "02:42:36", "text": "印地语。这就是我所知道的全部。但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9758.55, "timestamp": "02:42:38", "text": "我做不好。你随便写点什么就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9760.63, "timestamp": "02:42:40", "text": "就这样，不知不觉地度过了这一刻。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9763.23, "timestamp": "02:42:43", "text": "这就是我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9765.429, "timestamp": "02:42:45", "text": "哇。你母亲是什么样的人？是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9768.63, "timestamp": "02:42:48", "text": "你的母语是什么？本地人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9770.87, "timestamp": "02:42:50", "text": "马拉雅拉姆语。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9773.99, "timestamp": "02:42:53", "text": "我在这方面也不擅长。我看不懂或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9776.71, "timestamp": "02:42:56", "text": "写。"}]